
%9Syntax:%9

MARK%|

%9Description:%9

    Removes the old trackbar line from the active window and draws a new
    one at its bottom - same as /TRACKBAR MARK. Also works in windows
    listed in trackbar_ignore_windows. With trackbar_all_manual = ON this
    is the only way to move the line. Provided by the trackbar.pl script.

%9Examples:%9

    /MARK

%9See also:%9 TRACKBAR

